  {
   "id": "wrc-generations-201963@1.3.24.1",
   "gameId": "wrc-generations-201963",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.3.24.1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-11-23T15:03:46.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello drivers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are pleased to announce a new hotfix (v 1.3.24.1) for the Steam version of WRC Generations is now available to download on your Steam client.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Below today’s list of fixes, you will also find a non-exhaustive list of the fixes we are currently working on resolving through the next updates.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Patch Notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed random crash with some Thrustmaster peripherals",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Note: Some Thrustmaster peripherals might still encounter issues, an additional update to resolve them is under development.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue preventing to see specific Career screens on an Nvidia 4090 card",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a crash when DLSS FG was activated without DLSS SR at launch",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a crash after tutorial when player nickname used specific typeface within the Drivercard",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Note: There still are FFB issues with Logitech steering wheels, this should be resolved by a future update of the Logitech G HUB.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Fixed in a future update",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The throttle is only effective when pressed to at least 95%.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "In Clubs you can use your own liveries in Realistic Rallies, creating potential issues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "In Leagues the wrong groups can be displayed in some Leagues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "There is an invisible obstacle appearing in Turkey SSS Marmaris. The stage has temporarily been disabled in competitive modes and will be re-enabled when the issue is fixed in a future patch.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Wet tyres don't have as much of a meaningful improvement over soft tyres as they should have.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "In Leagues and Clubs, car setup and tyres selection are only considered in the first special stage of a rally, not in the following stages.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "There are sound issues with Audi Quattro 1 and Skoda Fabia Rally2.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added tooltips explaining each car setup option",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added understandable information on content involving DLCs (Liveries using DLC stickers, Liveries using DLC cars, Stickers using DLC stickers...)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Some Nvidia DLSS option interdependencies are wrong.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
